#. type: TH
#: en/live-config.7:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "LIVE-CONFIG"
msgstr "LIVE-CONFIG"

#. type: TH
#: en/live-config.7:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "2026-08-31"
msgstr "2026-08-31"

#. type: TH
#: en/live-config.7:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "11.0.5.18"
msgstr "11.0.5.18"

#. type: TH
#: en/live-config.7:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "MiniOS Live Project"
msgstr "Proyek MiniOS Live"

#. type: SH
#: en/live-config.7:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "NAMA"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:15
msgid "B<live-config> - System Configuration Components"
msgstr "B<live-config> - Komponen Konfigurasi Sistem"

#. type: SH
#: en/live-config.7:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "DESKRIPSI"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:18
msgid ""
"B<live-config> contains the components that configure a live system during "
"the boot process (late userspace)."
msgstr ""
"B<live-config> berisi komponen-komponen yang mengonfigurasi sistem live "
"selama proses boot (userspace akhir)."

#. type: SH
#: en/live-config.7:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "CONFIGURATION"
msgstr "KONFIGURASI"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:21
msgid ""
"B<live-config> can be configured through boot parameters or configuration "
"files. If both mechanisms are used for a certain option, the boot parameters "
"take precedence over the configuration files. Components that record state "
"under /var/lib/live/config normally run only once; synchronization and "
"stateless components may run on each invocation."
msgstr ""
"B<live-config> dapat dikonfigurasi melalui parameter boot atau berkas "
"konfigurasi. Jika kedua mekanisme digunakan untuk suatu opsi, parameter boot "
"memiliki prioritas dibandingkan berkas konfigurasi. Komponen yang mencatat "
"status di bawah /var/lib/live/config biasanya hanya dijalankan satu kali; "
"komponen sinkronisasi dan stateless dapat dijalankan pada setiap pemanggilan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:23
msgid ""
"If I<live-build>(7) is used to build the live system, the live-config "
"parameters used by default can be set through the --bootappend-live option, "
"see I<lb_config>(1) manual page."
msgstr ""
"Jika I<live-build>(7) digunakan untuk membangun sistem live, parameter live-"
"config yang digunakan secara default dapat diatur melalui opsi --bootappend-"
"live, lihat halaman manual I<lb_config>(1)."

#. type: SS
#: en/live-config.7:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Boot Parameters (components)"
msgstr "Parameter Boot (komponen)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:26
msgid ""
"B<live-config> is only activated if 'boot=live' is used as a boot parameter. "
"By default, all components are run. The 'live-config.components' parameter "
"can restrict which components run, and 'live-config.nocomponents' can "
"exclude components. If both parameters are used, or either one is specified "
"multiple times, the last occurrence takes precedence."
msgstr ""
"B<live-config> hanya diaktifkan jika 'boot=live' digunakan sebagai parameter "
"boot. Secara default, semua komponen dijalankan. Parameter 'live-"
"config.components' dapat membatasi komponen mana yang dijalankan, dan 'live-"
"config.nocomponents' dapat mengecualikan komponen tertentu. Jika kedua "
"parameter digunakan, atau salah satu disebutkan beberapa kali, kemunculan "
"terakhir yang berlaku."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.components> | B<components>"
msgstr "B<live-config.components> | B<components>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:29
msgid "All components are run. This is what live images use by default."
msgstr ""
"Semua komponen dijalankan. Ini adalah apa yang digunakan oleh citra live "
"secara default."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.components>=I<COMPONENT1>,I<COMPONENT2>, ... I<COMPONENTn> | B<components>=I<COMPONENT1>,I<COMPONENT2>, ... I<COMPONENTn>"
msgstr "B<live-config.components>=I<KOMPONEN1>,I<KOMPONEN2>, ... I<KOMPONENn> | B<components>=I<KOMPONEN1>,I<KOMPONEN2>, ... I<KOMPONENn>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:31
msgid ""
"Only the specified components are run. Components are executed in the order "
"encoded in their filenames under /usr/lib/live/config, regardless of their "
"order in this list."
msgstr ""
"Hanya komponen yang ditentukan yang dijalankan. Komponen dieksekusi sesuai "
"urutan yang dikodekan dalam nama berkasnya di bawah /usr/lib/live/config, "
"tanpa memperhatikan urutan dalam daftar ini."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.nocomponents> | B<nocomponents>"
msgstr "B<live-config.nocomponents> | B<nocomponents>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:33
msgid "No component is run."
msgstr "Tidak ada komponen yang dijalankan."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.nocomponents>=I<COMPONENT1>,I<COMPONENT2>, ... I<COMPONENTn> | B<nocomponents>=I<COMPONENT1>,I<COMPONENT2>, ... I<COMPONENTn>"
msgstr "B<live-config.nocomponents>=I<KOMPONEN1>,I<KOMPONEN2>, ... I<KOMPONENn> | B<nocomponents>=I<KOMPONEN1>,I<KOMPONEN2>, ... I<KOMPONENn>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:35
msgid "All components are run, except the specified ones."
msgstr "Semua komponen dijalankan, kecuali yang ditentukan."

#. type: SS
#: en/live-config.7:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Boot Parameters (options)"
msgstr "Parameter Boot (opsi)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:38
msgid ""
"Some individual components can change their behaviour upon a boot parameter."
msgstr ""
"Beberapa komponen individu dapat mengubah perilakunya berdasarkan parameter "
"boot."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.debconf-preseed>=filesystem|medium|I<URL1>|I<URL2>| ... |I<URLn> | B<debconf-preseed>=medium|filesystem|I<URL1>|I<URL2>| ... |I<URLn>"
msgstr "B<live-config.debconf-preseed>=filesystem|medium|I<URL1>|I<URL2>| ... |I<URLn> | B<debconf-preseed>=medium|filesystem|I<URL1>|I<URL2>| ... |I<URLn>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:41
msgid ""
"Allows one to fetch and apply one or more debconf preseed files to be "
"applied to the debconf database. Note that the URLs must be fetchable by "
"wget (http, ftp or file://)."
msgstr ""
"Memungkinkan untuk mengambil dan menerapkan satu atau lebih file preseed "
"debconf untuk diterapkan ke database debconf. Perhatikan bahwa URL harus "
"dapat diambil oleh wget (http, ftp, atau file://)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:43 en/live-config.7:115
msgid ""
"If the file is placed on the live medium, it can be fetched with file:///run/"
"initramfs/memory/data/I<FILE>, or with file:///I<FILE> if it is in the root "
"filesystem of the live system itself."
msgstr ""
"Jika file ditempatkan pada media live, ia dapat diambil dengan file:///lib/"
"live/mount/medium/I<FILE>, atau dengan file:///I<FILE> jika berada di sistem "
"berkas root dari sistem live itu sendiri."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:45
msgid ""
"All preseed files in /usr/lib/live/config-preseed/ in the root filesystem of "
"the live system can be automatically enabled with the keyword 'filesystem'."
msgstr ""
"Semua file preseed di /usr/lib/live/config-preseed/ di sistem berkas root "
"sistem live dapat diaktifkan secara otomatis dengan kata kunci 'filesystem'."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:47
msgid ""
"All preseed files in /minios/config-preseed/ of the live medium can be "
"automatically enabled with the keyword 'medium'."
msgstr ""
"Semua file preseed di /minios/config-preseed/ dari media live dapat "
"diaktifkan secara otomatis dengan kata kunci 'medium'."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:49
msgid ""
"If several mechanisms are combined, then filesystem preseed files are "
"applied first, then medium preseed files, and last the network preseed files."
msgstr ""
"Jika beberapa mekanisme digabungkan, maka file preseed sistem file "
"diterapkan pertama, kemudian file preseed media, dan terakhir file preseed "
"jaringan."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.hostname>=I<HOSTNAME> | B<hostname>=I<HOSTNAME>"
msgstr "B<live-config.hostname>=I<NAMA HOST> | B<hostname>=I<NAMA HOST>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:51
msgid ""
"Allows one to set the hostname of the system. The MiniOS default is 'minios'."
msgstr ""
"Memungkinkan pengguna untuk mengatur nama host sistem. Nilai default MiniOS "
"adalah 'minios'."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.network-method>=dhcp|static|off | B<network-method>=dhcp|static|off"
msgstr "B<live-config.network-method>=dhcp|static|off | B<network-method>=dhcp|static|off"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:53
msgid ""
"Selects wired network policy. Unset and dhcp leave the image default "
"unchanged. Static writes configuration for the selected backend; off "
"disables automatic IPv4 configuration for the selected interface."
msgstr ""
"Memilih kebijakan jaringan kabel. Jika tidak diatur atau menggunakan dhcp, "
"pengaturan default image tidak berubah. Static menulis konfigurasi untuk "
"backend yang dipilih; off menonaktifkan konfigurasi IPv4 otomatis untuk "
"antarmuka yang dipilih."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.network-interface>=I<INTERFACE> | B<network-interface>=I<INTERFACE>"
msgstr "B<live-config.network-interface>=I<INTERFACE> | B<network-interface>=I<INTERFACE>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:55
msgid ""
"Selects the wired interface. If omitted for static or off, the only wired "
"non-loopback interface is selected automatically; zero or multiple "
"candidates require an explicit value."
msgstr ""
"Memilih antarmuka kabel. Jika tidak ditentukan untuk static atau off, satu-"
"satunya antarmuka kabel non-loopback akan dipilih secara otomatis; jika ada "
"nol atau lebih dari satu kandidat, nilai eksplisit diperlukan."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.network-address>=I<IPV4> | B<network-address>=I<IPV4>"
msgstr "B<live-config.network-address>=I<IPV4> | B<network-address>=I<IPV4>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:57 en/live-config.7:183
msgid "Sets the static IPv4 address."
msgstr "Mengatur alamat IPv4 statis."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.network-prefix>=I<PREFIX> | B<network-prefix>=I<PREFIX>"
msgstr "B<live-config.network-prefix>=I<PREFIX> | B<network-prefix>=I<PREFIX>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:59
msgid "Sets the IPv4 prefix length from 0 to 32. The static default is 24."
msgstr ""
"Mengatur panjang prefix IPv4 dari 0 hingga 32. Nilai default static adalah "
"24."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.network-gateway>=I<IPV4> | B<network-gateway>=I<IPV4>"
msgstr "B<live-config.network-gateway>=I<IPV4> | B<network-gateway>=I<IPV4>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:61
msgid "Sets the optional IPv4 gateway."
msgstr "Mengatur gateway IPv4 opsional."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.network-dns>=I<ADDRESS1,ADDRESS2> | B<network-dns>=I<ADDRESS1,ADDRESS2>"
msgstr "B<live-config.network-dns>=I<ADDRESS1,ADDRESS2> | B<network-dns>=I<ADDRESS1,ADDRESS2>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:63
msgid "Sets optional comma-separated DNS server addresses."
msgstr "Mengatur alamat server DNS opsional yang dipisahkan dengan koma."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.network-backend>=auto|nm|ifupdown | B<network-backend>=auto|nm|ifupdown"
msgstr "B<live-config.network-backend>=auto|nm|ifupdown | B<network-backend>=auto|nm|ifupdown"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:65
msgid ""
"Selects the network backend. Auto prefers NetworkManager and falls back to "
"ifupdown. Forced ifupdown marks the interface unmanaged by NetworkManager "
"when both stacks are installed."
msgstr ""
"Memilih backend jaringan. Auto akan memilih NetworkManager dan jika gagal "
"akan menggunakan ifupdown. Jika dipaksa menggunakan ifupdown, antarmuka akan "
"ditandai sebagai unmanaged oleh NetworkManager ketika kedua stack terpasang."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.username>=I<USERNAME> | B<username>=I<USERNAME>"
msgstr "B<live-config.username>=I<NAMA PENGGUNA> | B<username>=I<NAMA PENGGUNA>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:67
msgid ""
"Allows one to set the username that gets created for autologin. The MiniOS "
"default is 'live'."
msgstr ""
"Memungkinkan pengguna untuk mengatur nama pengguna yang dibuat untuk "
"autologin. Nilai default MiniOS adalah 'live'."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.user-default-groups>=I<GROUP1>,I<GROUP2> ... I<GROUPn> | B<user-default-groups>=I<GROUP1>,I<GROUP2> ... I<GROUPn>"
msgstr "B<live-config.user-default-groups>=I<GRUP1>,I<GRUP2> ... I<GRUPn> | B<user-default-groups>=I<GRUP1>,I<GRUP2> ... I<GRUPn>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:69
msgid ""
"Sets the supplementary groups for the user created for autologin. Group "
"names may be separated by commas or spaces. The MiniOS default is 'dialout "
"cdrom floppy audio video plugdev users fuse plugdev netdev powerdev scanner "
"bluetooth weston-launch kvm libvirt libvirt-qemu vboxusers lpadmin dip "
"sambashare docker wireshark'."
msgstr ""
"Mengatur grup tambahan untuk pengguna yang dibuat untuk autologin. Nama grup "
"dapat dipisahkan dengan koma atau spasi. Default MiniOS adalah 'dialout "
"cdrom floppy audio video plugdev users fuse plugdev netdev powerdev scanner "
"bluetooth weston-launch kvm libvirt libvirt-qemu vboxusers lpadmin dip "
"sambashare docker wireshark'."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.user-fullname>=\"I<USER FULLNAME>\" | B<user-fullname>=\"I<USER FULLNAME>\""
msgstr "B<live-config.user-fullname>=\"I<NAMA LENGKAP PENGGUNA>\" | B<user-fullname>=\"I<NAMA LENGKAP PENGGUNA>\""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:71
msgid ""
"Allows one to set the fullname of the user created for autologin. The MiniOS "
"default is 'MiniOS Live User'."
msgstr ""
"Memungkinkan pengguna untuk mengatur nama lengkap pengguna yang dibuat untuk "
"autologin. Nilai default MiniOS adalah 'MiniOS Live User'."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.root-password>=I<PASSWORD> | B<root-password>=I<PASSWORD>"
msgstr "B<live-config.root-password>=I<KATA SANDI> | B<root-password>=I<KATA SANDI>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:73
msgid "Allows setting the root password in plain text."
msgstr "Memungkinkan pengaturan kata sandi root dalam teks biasa."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.root-password-crypted>=I<PASSWORD> | B<root-password-crypted>=I<PASSWORD>"
msgstr "B<live-config.root-password-crypted>=I<KATA SANDI> | B<root-password-crypted>=I<KATA SANDI>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:75
msgid "Allows setting the root password in crypted form."
msgstr "Memungkinkan pengaturan kata sandi root dalam bentuk terenkripsi."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.user-password>=I<PASSWORD> | B<user-password>=I<PASSWORD>"
msgstr "B<live-config.user-password>=I<KATA SANDI> | B<user-password>=I<KATA SANDI>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:77
msgid "Allows setting the user password in plain text."
msgstr "Memungkinkan pengaturan kata sandi pengguna dalam teks biasa."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.user-password-crypted>=I<PASSWORD> | B<user-password-crypted>=I<PASSWORD>"
msgstr "B<live-config.user-password-crypted>=I<KATA SANDI> | B<user-password-crypted>=I<KATA SANDI>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:79
msgid "Allows setting the user password in crypted form."
msgstr "Memungkinkan pengaturan kata sandi pengguna dalam bentuk terenkripsi."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:79
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.locales>=I<LOCALE1>,I<LOCALE2> ... I<LOCALEn> | B<locales>=I<LOCALE1>,I<LOCALE2> ... I<LOCALEn>"
msgstr "B<live-config.locales>=I<LOKAL1>,I<LOKAL2> ... I<LOKALn> | B<locales>=I<LOKAL1>,I<LOKAL2> ... I<LOKALn>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:81
msgid ""
"Allows one to set the locale of the system, e.g. 'de_CH.UTF-8'. The default "
"is 'en_US.UTF-8'. In case the selected locale is not already available on "
"the system, it is automatically generated on the fly."
msgstr ""
"Memungkinkan seseorang untuk mengatur lokal sistem, misalnya 'de_CH.UTF-8'. "
"Defaultnya adalah 'en_US.UTF-8'. Jika lokal yang dipilih belum tersedia di "
"sistem, ia akan secara otomatis dibuat saat itu juga."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:81
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.timezone>=I<TIMEZONE> | B<timezone>=I<TIMEZONE>"
msgstr "B<live-config.timezone>=I<ZONA_WAKTU> | B<timezone>=I<ZONA_WAKTU>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:83
msgid ""
"Allows one to set the timezone of the system, e.g. 'Europe/Zurich'. The "
"default is 'UTC'."
msgstr ""
"Memungkinkan seseorang untuk mengatur zona waktu sistem, misalnya 'Europe/"
"Zurich'. Defaultnya adalah 'UTC'."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:83
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.keyboard-model>=I<KEYBOARD_MODEL> | B<keyboard-model>=I<KEYBOARD_MODEL>"
msgstr "B<live-config.keyboard-model>=I<MODEL_KEYBOARD> | B<keyboard-model>=I<MODEL_KEYBOARD>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:85
msgid "Allows one to change the keyboard model. There is no default value set."
msgstr ""
"Memungkinkan seseorang untuk mengubah model keyboard. Tidak ada nilai "
"default yang diatur."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.keyboard-layouts>=I<KEYBOARD_LAYOUT1>,I<KEYBOARD_LAYOUT2> ... I<KEYBOARD_LAYOUTn> | B<keyboard-layouts>=I<KEYBOARD_LAYOUT1>,I<KEYBOARD_LAYOUT2> ... I<KEYBOARD_LAYOUTn>"
msgstr "B<live-config.keyboard-layouts>=I<LAYOUT_KEYBOARD1>,I<LAYOUT_KEYBOARD2> ... I<LAYOUT_KEYBOARDn> | B<keyboard-layouts>=I<LAYOUT_KEYBOARD1>,I<LAYOUT_KEYBOARD2> ... I<LAYOUT_KEYBOARDn>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:87
msgid ""
"Allows one to change the keyboard layouts. If more than one is specified, "
"the tools of the desktop environment will allow one to switch it under X11. "
"There is no default value set."
msgstr ""
"Memungkinkan seseorang untuk mengubah layout keyboard. Jika lebih dari satu "
"ditentukan, alat lingkungan desktop akan memungkinkan untuk beralih di bawah "
"X11. Tidak ada nilai default yang diatur."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:87
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.keyboard-variants>=I<KEYBOARD_VARIANT1>,I<KEYBOARD_VARIANT2> ... I<KEYBOARD_VARIANTn> | B<keyboard-variants>=I<KEYBOARD_VARIANT1>,I<KEYBOARD_VARIANT2> ... I<KEYBOARD_VARIANTn>"
msgstr "B<live-config.keyboard-variants>=I<VARIAN_KEYBOARD1>,I<VARIAN_KEYBOARD2> ... I<VARIAN_KEYBOARDn> | B<keyboard-variants>=I<VARIAN_KEYBOARD1>,I<VARIAN_KEYBOARD2> ... I<VARIAN_KEYBOARDn>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:89
msgid ""
"Allows one to change the keyboard variants. If more than one is specified, "
"the same number of values as keyboard-layouts values should be specified as "
"they will be matched one-to-one in the order specified. Blank values are "
"allowed. The tools of the desktop environment will allow one to switch "
"between each layout and variant pair under X11. There is no default value "
"set."
msgstr ""
"Memungkinkan seseorang untuk mengubah varian keyboard. Jika lebih dari satu "
"ditentukan, jumlah nilai yang sama dengan nilai keyboard-layouts harus "
"ditentukan karena akan dicocokkan satu-ke-satu dalam urutan yang ditentukan. "
"Nilai kosong diizinkan. Alat-alat lingkungan desktop akan memungkinkan untuk "
"beralih antara setiap pasangan tata letak dan varian di bawah X11. Tidak ada "
"nilai default yang diatur."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:89
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.keyboard-options>=I<KEYBOARD_OPTIONS> | B<keyboard-options>=I<KEYBOARD_OPTIONS>"
msgstr "B<live-config.keyboard-options>=I<OPSI_KEYBOARD> | B<keyboard-options>=I<OPSI_KEYBOARD>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:91
msgid ""
"Allows one to change the keyboard options. There is no default value set."
msgstr ""
"Memungkinkan seseorang untuk mengubah opsi keyboard. Tidak ada nilai default "
"yang diatur."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:91
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.sysv-rc>=I<SERVICE1>,I<SERVICE2> ... I<SERVICEn> | B<sysv-rc>=I<SERVICE1>,I<SERVICE2> ... I<SERVICEn>"
msgstr "B<live-config.sysv-rc>=I<LAYANAN1>,I<LAYANAN2> ... I<LAYANANn> | B<sysv-rc>=I<LAYANAN1>,I<LAYANAN2> ... I<LAYANANn>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:93
msgid "Allows one to disable sysv services through update-rc.d."
msgstr ""
"Memungkinkan seseorang untuk menonaktifkan layanan sysv melalui update-rc.d."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:93
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.utc>=B<yes>|no | B<utc>=B<yes>|no"
msgstr "B<live-config.utc>=B<ya>|tidak | B<utc>=B<ya>|tidak"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:95
msgid ""
"Allows one to change if the system is assuming that the hardware clock is "
"set to UTC or not. The default is 'yes'."
msgstr ""
"Memungkinkan seseorang untuk mengubah apakah sistem mengasumsikan bahwa jam "
"perangkat keras diatur ke UTC atau tidak. Defaultnya adalah 'ya'."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:95
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.xorg-xsession-manager=>I<X_SESSION_MANAGER> | B<x-session-manager>=I<X_SESSION_MANAGER>"
msgstr "B<live-config.xorg-xsession-manager=>I<X_SESSION_MANAGER> | B<x-session-manager>=I<X_SESSION_MANAGER>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:97
msgid "Allows one to set the x-session-manager through update-alternatives."
msgstr ""
"Memungkinkan seseorang untuk mengatur manajer sesi X melalui update-"
"alternatives."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:97
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.xorg-driver>=I<XORG_DRIVER> | B<xorg-driver>=I<XORG_DRIVER>"
msgstr "B<live-config.xorg-driver>=I<DRIVER_XORG> | B<xorg-driver>=I<DRIVER_XORG>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:99
msgid ""
"Allows one to set xorg driver instead of autodetecting it. If a PCI ID is "
"specified in /usr/share/live/config/xserver-xorg/I<DRIVER>.ids within the "
"live system, the I<DRIVER> is enforced for these devices. If both a boot "
"parameter and an override are found, the boot parameter takes precedence."
msgstr ""
"Memungkinkan seseorang untuk mengatur driver xorg alih-alih mendeteksinya "
"secara otomatis. Jika ID PCI ditentukan dalam /usr/share/live/config/xserver-"
"xorg/I<DRIVER>.ids dalam sistem live, I<DRIVER> diberlakukan untuk perangkat "
"ini. Jika parameter boot dan override ditemukan, parameter boot yang "
"diutamakan."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:99
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.xorg-resolution>=I<XORG_RESOLUTION> | B<xorg-resolution>=I<XORG_RESOLUTION>"
msgstr "B<live-config.xorg-resolution>=I<RESOLUSI_XORG> | B<xorg-resolution>=I<RESOLUSI_XORG>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:101
msgid ""
"Allows one to set xorg resolution instead of autodetecting it, e.g. 1024x768."
msgstr ""
"Memungkinkan seseorang untuk mengatur resolusi xorg alih-alih mendeteksinya "
"secara otomatis, misalnya 1024x768."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:101
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.wlan-driver>=I<WLAN_DRIVER> | B<wlan-driver>=I<WLAN_DRIVER>"
msgstr "B<live-config.wlan-driver>=I<DRIVER_WLAN> | B<wlan-driver>=I<DRIVER_WLAN>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:103
msgid ""
"Allows one to set WLAN driver instead of autodetecting it. If a PCI ID is "
"specified in /usr/share/live/config/broadcom-sta/I<DRIVER>.ids within the "
"live system, the I<DRIVER> is enforced for these devices. If both a boot "
"parameter and an override are found, the boot parameter takes precedence."
msgstr ""
"Memungkinkan seseorang untuk mengatur driver WLAN alih-alih mendeteksinya "
"secara otomatis. Jika ID PCI ditentukan dalam /usr/share/live/config/"
"broadcom-sta/I<DRIVER>.ids dalam sistem live, I<DRIVER> diberlakukan untuk "
"perangkat ini. Jika parameter boot dan override ditemukan, parameter boot "
"yang diutamakan."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:103
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.module-mode>=simple|merged | B<module-mode>=simple|merged"
msgstr "B<live-config.module-mode>=simple|merged | B<module-mode>=simple|merged"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:105
msgid ""
"Allows you to specify the module mode for live configuration. When set to "
"\"merged\", the system will update user accounts, rebuild caches, and "
"refresh package settings so that configuration changes are dynamically "
"integrated into the running system."
msgstr ""
"Memungkinkan Anda menentukan mode modul untuk konfigurasi live. Jika disetel "
"ke \"merged\", sistem akan memperbarui akun pengguna, membangun ulang cache, "
"dan menyegarkan pengaturan paket agar perubahan konfigurasi terintegrasi "
"secara dinamis ke dalam sistem yang sedang berjalan."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:105
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.link-user-dirs> | B<link-user-dirs>"
msgstr "B<live-config.link-user-dirs> | B<link-user-dirs>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:107
msgid ""
"Links the managed user directories to the configured path on the MiniOS data "
"medium."
msgstr ""
"Membuat tautan direktori pengguna yang dikelola ke path yang dikonfigurasi "
"pada media data MiniOS."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:107
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.bind-user-dirs> | B<bind-user-dirs>"
msgstr "B<live-config.bind-user-dirs> | B<bind-user-dirs>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:109
msgid ""
"Bind-mounts the managed user directories from the configured path on the "
"MiniOS data medium. This option is mutually exclusive with link-user-dirs."
msgstr ""
"Melakukan bind-mount direktori pengguna yang dikelola dari path yang "
"dikonfigurasi pada media data MiniOS. Opsi ini tidak dapat digunakan "
"bersamaan dengan link-user-dirs."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:109
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.user-dirs-path>=I<PATH> | B<user-dirs-path>=I<PATH>"
msgstr "B<live-config.user-dirs-path>=I<PATH> | B<user-dirs-path>=I<PATH>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:111
msgid ""
"Sets the media-relative path used by link-user-dirs or bind-user-dirs. The "
"default is /minios/userdata."
msgstr ""
"Mengatur path relatif media yang digunakan oleh link-user-dirs atau bind-"
"user-dirs. Default-nya adalah /minios/userdata."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:111
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.hooks>=filesystem|medium|I<URL1>|I<URL2>| ... |I<URLn> | B<hooks>=medium|filesystem|I<URL1>|I<URL2>| ... |I<URLn>"
msgstr "B<live-config.hooks>=filesystem|medium|I<URL1>|I<URL2>| ... |I<URLn> | B<hooks>=medium|filesystem|I<URL1>|I<URL2>| ... |I<URLn>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:113
msgid ""
"Allows one to fetch and execute one or more arbitrary files. Note that the "
"URLs must be fetchable by wget (http, ftp or file://), the files are "
"executed in /tmp of the running live system, and that the files needs their "
"dependencies, if any, already installed, e.g. if a python script should be "
"executed the system needs python installed. Some hooks for some common use-"
"cases are available at /usr/share/doc/live-config/examples/hooks/."
msgstr ""
"Memungkinkan seseorang untuk mengambil dan menjalankan satu atau lebih file "
"arbitrer. Perhatikan bahwa URL harus dapat diambil oleh wget (http, ftp atau "
"file://), file dijalankan di /tmp sistem live yang sedang berjalan, dan file "
"tersebut membutuhkan dependensinya, jika ada, sudah terinstal, misalnya jika "
"skrip python harus dijalankan, sistem membutuhkan python terinstal. Beberapa "
"kait untuk kasus penggunaan umum tersedia di /usr/share/doc/live-config/"
"examples/hooks/."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:117
msgid ""
"All hooks in /usr/lib/live/config-hooks/ in the root filesystem of the live "
"system can be automatically enabled with the keyword 'filesystem'."
msgstr ""
"Semua kait di /usr/lib/live/config-hooks/ di sistem berkas root sistem live "
"dapat diaktifkan secara otomatis dengan kata kunci 'filesystem'."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:119
msgid ""
"All hooks in /minios/config-hooks/ of the live medium can be automatically "
"enabled with the keyword 'medium'."
msgstr ""
"Semua kait di /minios/config-hooks/ dari media live dapat diaktifkan secara "
"otomatis dengan kata kunci 'medium'."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:121
msgid ""
"If several mechanisms are combined, then filesystem hooks are executed "
"first, then medium hooks, and last the network hooks."
msgstr ""
"Jika beberapa mekanisme digabungkan, maka kait sistem berkas dieksekusi "
"terlebih dahulu, kemudian kait media, dan terakhir kait jaringan."

#. type: SS
#: en/live-config.7:122
#, no-wrap
msgid "Boot Parameters (shortcuts)"
msgstr "Parameter Boot (pintasan)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:124
msgid ""
"For some common use cases where it would require to combine several "
"individual parameters, B<live-config> provides shortcuts. This allows both "
"to have full granularity over all the options, as well keep things simple."
msgstr ""
"Untuk beberapa kasus penggunaan umum di mana dibutuhkan kombinasi beberapa "
"parameter individual, B<live-config> menyediakan pintasan. Ini memungkinkan "
"untuk memiliki granularitas penuh atas semua opsi, serta menjaga semuanya "
"tetap sederhana."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:125
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.noroot> | B<noroot>"
msgstr "B<live-config.noroot> | B<noroot>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:127
msgid ""
"Disables root password setup and the MiniOS sudo and PolicyKit privilege "
"grants."
msgstr ""
"Menonaktifkan pengaturan sandi root serta pemberian hak istimewa sudo dan "
"PolicyKit pada MiniOS."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:127
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.sudo-mode>=B<passwordless>|password|disabled | B<sudo-mode>=B<passwordless>|password|disabled"
msgstr "B<live-config.sudo-mode>=B<passwordless>|password|disabled | B<sudo-mode>=B<passwordless>|password|disabled"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:129
msgid ""
"Controls sudo setup for the live user. The default, and historical MiniOS "
"behavior when unset, is B<passwordless>. The B<password> mode keeps sudo "
"access but requires the live user's password. The B<disabled> mode removes "
"the MiniOS sudo grant and keeps the live user out of the sudo group when the "
"user is created. The older B<noroot> shortcut still overrides this and "
"disables root privilege setup more broadly."
msgstr ""
"Mengatur konfigurasi sudo untuk pengguna live. Default, dan perilaku MiniOS "
"sebelumnya jika tidak diatur, adalah B<passwordless>. Mode B<password> tetap "
"memberikan akses sudo tetapi membutuhkan sandi pengguna live. Mode "
"B<disabled> menghapus hak sudo MiniOS dan memastikan pengguna live tidak "
"masuk grup sudo saat dibuat. Pintasan lama B<noroot> tetap akan menimpa ini "
"dan menonaktifkan pengaturan hak root secara lebih luas."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:129
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.polkit-mode>=B<passwordless>|password|disabled | B<polkit-mode>=B<passwordless>|password|disabled"
msgstr "B<live-config.polkit-mode>=B<passwordless>|password|disabled | B<polkit-mode>=B<passwordless>|password|disabled"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:131
msgid ""
"Controls MiniOS PolicyKit convenience rules. The default, and historical "
"MiniOS behavior when unset, is B<passwordless>, which grants local "
"administrative actions without a password for the live/sudo user. The "
"B<password> and B<disabled> modes both remove that MiniOS passwordless rule, "
"so normal distribution PolicyKit authentication applies. B<disabled> is not "
"a hard deny-all PolicyKit policy; use B<noroot> when the live user must not "
"gain administrative privileges."
msgstr ""
"Mengatur aturan kemudahan PolicyKit MiniOS. Default, dan perilaku MiniOS "
"sebelumnya jika tidak diatur, adalah B<passwordless>, yang memberikan hak "
"administratif lokal tanpa sandi untuk pengguna live/sudo. Mode B<password> "
"dan B<disabled> keduanya menghapus aturan passwordless MiniOS tersebut, "
"sehingga autentikasi PolicyKit distribusi normal berlaku. B<disabled> bukan "
"kebijakan PolicyKit tolak-semua secara ketat; gunakan B<noroot> jika "
"pengguna live tidak boleh mendapatkan hak administratif."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:131
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.ssh-permit-root-login>=B<true>|false | B<ssh-permit-root-login>=B<true>|false"
msgstr "B<live-config.ssh-permit-root-login>=B<true>|false | B<ssh-permit-root-login>=B<true>|false"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:133
msgid ""
"Writes an OpenSSH PermitRootLogin policy when explicitly set and openssh-"
"server is installed."
msgstr ""
"Menulis kebijakan OpenSSH PermitRootLogin ketika diatur secara eksplisit dan "
"openssh-server terpasang."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:133
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.ssh-password-authentication>=B<true>|false | B<ssh-password-authentication>=B<true>|false"
msgstr "B<live-config.ssh-password-authentication>=B<true>|false | B<ssh-password-authentication>=B<true>|false"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:135
msgid ""
"Writes an OpenSSH PasswordAuthentication policy when explicitly set and "
"openssh-server is installed."
msgstr ""
"Menulis kebijakan OpenSSH PasswordAuthentication ketika diatur secara "
"eksplisit dan openssh-server terpasang."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:135
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.xrdp-mode>=B<relaxed>|hardened|disabled | B<xrdp-mode>=B<relaxed>|hardened|disabled"
msgstr "B<live-config.xrdp-mode>=B<relaxed>|hardened|disabled | B<xrdp-mode>=B<relaxed>|hardened|disabled"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:137
msgid ""
"Controls XRDP posture when xrdp is installed. B<relaxed> preserves "
"historical MiniOS defaults. B<hardened> binds XRDP to localhost, restores "
"negotiated/high security settings, and disables XRDP root login. B<disabled> "
"disables/stops XRDP through minios-svc when available."
msgstr ""
"Mengatur postur XRDP saat xrdp terpasang. B<relaxed> mempertahankan default "
"MiniOS historis. B<hardened> mengikat XRDP ke localhost, mengaktifkan "
"pengaturan keamanan tinggi/negosiasi, dan menonaktifkan login root XRDP. "
"B<disabled> menonaktifkan/menghentikan XRDP melalui minios-svc jika tersedia."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:137
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.x11-mode>=B<relaxed>|hardened | B<x11-mode>=B<relaxed>|hardened"
msgstr "B<live-config.x11-mode>=B<relaxed>|hardened | B<x11-mode>=B<relaxed>|hardened"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:139
msgid ""
"Controls MiniOS X11 convenience posture. B<relaxed> preserves historical "
"compatibility. B<hardened> removes the permissive -ac X server option and "
"tightens Xwrapper.config when present."
msgstr ""
"Mengatur postur kemudahan X11 MiniOS. B<relaxed> mempertahankan "
"kompatibilitas historis. B<hardened> menghapus opsi X server -ac yang "
"permisif dan memperketat Xwrapper.config jika ada."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:139
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.issue-password-hints>=B<true>|false | B<issue-password-hints>=B<true>|false"
msgstr "B<live-config.issue-password-hints>=B<true>|false | B<issue-password-hints>=B<true>|false"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:141
msgid ""
"Controls whether /etc/issue shows the default MiniOS root/live password "
"hints."
msgstr ""
"Mengatur apakah /etc/issue akan menampilkan petunjuk sandi root/live default "
"MiniOS."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:141
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.lockscreen-mode>=B<relaxed>|hardened | B<lockscreen-mode>=B<relaxed>|hardened"
msgstr "B<live-config.lockscreen-mode>=B<relaxed>|hardened | B<lockscreen-mode>=B<relaxed>|hardened"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:143
msgid ""
"Controls whether live-config relaxes screen locking. B<relaxed> preserves "
"historical live-session convenience. B<hardened> avoids disabling GNOME "
"locking and enables xscreensaver locking where that file is present."
msgstr ""
"Mengatur apakah live-config melonggarkan penguncian layar. B<relaxed> "
"mempertahankan kemudahan sesi live historis. B<hardened> menghindari "
"penonaktifan penguncian GNOME dan mengaktifkan penguncian xscreensaver jika "
"berkas tersebut ada."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:143
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.noautologin> | B<noautologin>"
msgstr "B<live-config.noautologin> | B<noautologin>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:145
msgid ""
"Prevents setup of both automatic console login and graphical autologin. "
"Existing persistent configuration is not removed."
msgstr ""
"Mencegah pengaturan login konsol otomatis dan autologin grafis sekaligus. "
"Konfigurasi persisten yang sudah ada tidak dihapus."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:145
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.nottyautologin> | B<nottyautologin>"
msgstr "B<live-config.nottyautologin> | B<nottyautologin>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:147
msgid ""
"Prevents setup of automatic console login without affecting graphical "
"autologin. Existing persistent configuration is not removed."
msgstr ""
"Mencegah pengaturan login konsol otomatis tanpa memengaruhi autologin "
"grafis. Konfigurasi persisten yang sudah ada tidak dihapus."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:147
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.nox11autologin> | B<nox11autologin>"
msgstr "B<live-config.nox11autologin> | B<nox11autologin>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:149
msgid ""
"Prevents setup of graphical autologin without affecting console autologin. "
"Existing persistent configuration is not removed."
msgstr ""
"Mencegah pengaturan autologin grafis tanpa memengaruhi autologin konsol. "
"Konfigurasi persisten yang sudah ada tidak dihapus."

#. type: SS
#: en/live-config.7:150
#, no-wrap
msgid "Boot Parameters (special options)"
msgstr "Parameter Boot (opsi khusus)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:152
msgid "For special use cases there are some special boot parameters."
msgstr "Untuk kasus penggunaan khusus ada beberapa parameter boot khusus."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:153
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-config.debug> | B<debug>"
msgstr "B<live-config.debug> | B<debug>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:155
msgid "Enables debug output in live-config."
msgstr "Mengaktifkan output debug di live-config."

#. type: SS
#: en/live-config.7:156
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration Files"
msgstr "File Konfigurasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:158
msgid ""
"B<live-config> can be configured (but not activated) through configuration "
"files. Any supported boot parameter can be placed in B<LIVE_CONFIG_CMDLINE>, "
"and most options can alternatively be set through individual variables. The "
"'boot=live' parameter is still required to activate B<live-config>."
msgstr ""
"B<live-config> dapat dikonfigurasi (namun tidak diaktifkan) melalui berkas "
"konfigurasi. Parameter boot yang didukung dapat ditempatkan di "
"B<LIVE_CONFIG_CMDLINE>, dan sebagian besar opsi juga dapat diatur melalui "
"variabel individual. Parameter 'boot=live' tetap diperlukan untuk "
"mengaktifkan B<live-config>."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:160
msgid ""
"B<Note:> If configuration files are used, either (preferably) all boot "
"parameters should be put into the B<LIVE_CONFIG_CMDLINE> variable, or "
"individual variables can be set. If individual variables are used, the user "
"is required to ensure that all the necessary variables are set to create a "
"valid configuration."
msgstr ""
"B<Catatan:> Jika file konfigurasi digunakan, sebaiknya semua parameter boot "
"harus ditempatkan dalam variabel B<LIVE_CONFIG_CMDLINE>, atau variabel "
"individual dapat diatur. Jika variabel individual digunakan, pengguna "
"diwajibkan untuk memastikan bahwa semua variabel yang diperlukan diatur "
"untuk membuat konfigurasi yang valid."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:162
msgid ""
"Configuration files are read from /etc/live/config.conf and /etc/live/"
"config.conf.d/*.conf. At startup, minios/config.conf from the live medium is "
"copied to /etc/live/config.conf only if that file does not already exist. "
"Configuration directories on the live medium are not read. Files in /etc/"
"live/config.conf.d are sourced after /etc/live/config.conf."
msgstr ""
"Berkas konfigurasi dibaca dari /etc/live/config.conf dan /etc/live/"
"config.conf.d/*.conf. Saat startup, minios/config.conf dari media live akan "
"disalin ke /etc/live/config.conf hanya jika berkas tujuan belum ada. "
"Direktori konfigurasi pada media live tidak dibaca. Berkas di /etc/live/"
"config.conf.d akan dimuat setelah /etc/live/config.conf."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:164
msgid ""
"Although the configuration files placed in the configuration directories do "
"not require a particular name, it is suggested for consistency reasons to "
"either use 'vendor.conf' or 'project.conf' as a naming scheme (whereas "
"'vendor' or 'project' is replaced with the actual name, resulting in a "
"filename like 'progress-linux.conf')."
msgstr ""
"Meskipun file konfigurasi yang ditempatkan di direktori konfigurasi tidak "
"memerlukan nama tertentu, disarankan untuk alasan konsistensi untuk "
"menggunakan 'vendor.conf' atau 'project.conf' sebagai skema penamaan (di "
"mana 'vendor' atau 'project' diganti dengan nama sebenarnya, menghasilkan "
"nama file seperti 'progress-linux.conf')."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:166
msgid ""
"The actual content of the configuration files consists of one or more of the "
"following variables."
msgstr ""
"Konten aktual dari file konfigurasi terdiri dari satu atau lebih variabel "
"berikut."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:167
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<LIVE_CONFIG_CMDLINE>=I<PARAMETER1> I<PARAMETER2> ... I<PARAMETERn>"
msgstr "B<LIVE_CONFIG_CMDLINE>=I<PARAMETER1> I<PARAMETER2> ... I<PARAMETERn>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:169
msgid "This variable corresponds to the bootloader command line."
msgstr "Variabel ini sesuai dengan baris perintah bootloader."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:169
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<LIVE_CONFIG_COMPONENTS>=I<COMPONENT1>,I<COMPONENT2>, ... I<COMPONENTn>"
msgstr "B<LIVE_CONFIG_COMPONENTS>=I<KOMPONEN1>,I<KOMPONEN2>, ... I<KOMPONENn>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:171
msgid ""
"This variable corresponds to the 'B<live-"
"config.components>=I<COMPONENT1>,I<COMPONENT2>, ... I<COMPONENTn>' parameter."
msgstr ""
"Variabel ini sesuai dengan parameter 'B<live-"
"config.components>=I<KOMPONEN1>,I<KOMPONEN2>, ... I<KOMPONENn>'."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:171
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<LIVE_CONFIG_NOCOMPONENTS>=I<COMPONENT1>,I<COMPONENT2>, ... I<COMPONENTn>"
msgstr "B<LIVE_CONFIG_NOCOMPONENTS>=I<KOMPONEN1>,I<KOMPONEN2>, ... I<KOMPONENn>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:173
msgid ""
"This variable corresponds to the 'B<live-"
