"path>=I<JALUR>'. Variabel ini menentukan jalur untuk direktori pengguna di "
"media."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:267
msgid ""
"User-media link and bind modes are mutually exclusive. The default path is /"
"minios/userdata relative to the existing /run/initramfs/memory/data mount.  "
"Only writable local block-backed FAT32, exFAT, and NTFS media are accepted.  "
"Network, optical, RAM, overlay, read-only, unsupported filesystems, and "
"toram, toram=full, or toram=trim are rejected. Paths may not contain "
"traversal, empty segments, control characters, or unsafe names. Desktop, "
"Documents, Downloads, Music, Pictures, Public, Templates, and Videos are "
"managed. Migration refuses to merge two populated trees; disabling the "
"feature copies managed data back.  State and status are recorded under /var/"
"lib/live/config."
msgstr ""
"Mode tautan dan bind media pengguna bersifat eksklusif satu sama lain. Jalur "
"default adalah /minios/userdata relatif terhadap mount /run/initramfs/memory/"
"data yang sudah ada. Hanya media FAT32, exFAT, dan NTFS lokal yang dapat "
"ditulis dan berbasis blok yang diterima. Media jaringan, optik, RAM, "
"overlay, hanya-baca, sistem berkas yang tidak didukung, serta toram, "
"toram=full, atau toram=trim akan ditolak. Jalur tidak boleh mengandung "
"traversal, segmen kosong, karakter kontrol, atau nama yang tidak aman. "
"Direktori Desktop, Documents, Downloads, Music, Pictures, Public, Templates, "
"dan Videos dikelola. Migrasi menolak menggabungkan dua pohon yang sudah "
"berisi data; menonaktifkan fitur ini akan menyalin data yang dikelola "
"kembali. Status dan informasi dicatat di /var/lib/live/config."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:267
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<LIVE_MODULE_MODE>=simple|merged"
msgstr "B<LIVE_MODULE_MODE>=simple|merged"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:269
msgid ""
"This variable holds the state specified by the 'live-config.module-mode' (or "
"'module-mode') parameter. When it is set to \"merged\", the live system "
"applies updates (via minios-update-users, minios-update-cache, and minios-"
"update-dpkg) to merge custom configurations with the base environment."
msgstr ""
"Variabel ini menyimpan status yang ditentukan oleh parameter 'live-"
"config.module-mode' (atau 'module-mode'). Jika disetel ke \"merged\", sistem "
"live akan menerapkan pembaruan (melalui minios-update-users, minios-update-"
"cache, dan minios-update-dpkg) untuk menggabungkan konfigurasi khusus dengan "
"lingkungan dasar."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:269
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<LIVE_CONFIG_DEBUG>=true|false"
msgstr "B<LIVE_CONFIG_DEBUG>=true|false"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:271
msgid "This variable corresponds to the 'B<live-config.debug>' parameter."
msgstr "Variabel ini sesuai dengan parameter 'B<live-config.debug>'."

#. type: SH
#: en/live-config.7:272
#, no-wrap
msgid "CUSTOMIZATION"
msgstr "KUSTOMISASI"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:274
msgid ""
"B<live-config> can be easily customized for downstream projects or local "
"usage."
msgstr ""
"B<live-config> dapat dengan mudah disesuaikan untuk proyek-proyek hilir atau "
"penggunaan lokal."

#. type: SS
#: en/live-config.7:275
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adding new config components"
msgstr "Menambahkan komponen konfigurasi baru"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:277
msgid ""
"Downstream projects can put their components into /usr/lib/live/config and "
"do not need to do anything else, the components will be called automatically "
"during boot."
msgstr ""
"Proyek hilir dapat menempatkan komponen mereka ke dalam /usr/lib/live/config "
"dan tidak perlu melakukan hal lain, komponen akan dipanggil secara otomatis "
"saat boot."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:279
msgid ""
"The components are best put into an own debian package. A sample package "
"containing an example component can be found in /usr/share/doc/live-config/"
"examples."
msgstr ""
"Komponen-komponen tersebut sebaiknya dimasukkan ke dalam paket debian "
"sendiri. Contoh paket yang berisi komponen contoh dapat ditemukan di /usr/"
"share/doc/live-config/examples."

#. type: SS
#: en/live-config.7:280
#, no-wrap
msgid "Removing existing config components"
msgstr "Menghapus komponen konfigurasi yang ada"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:282
msgid ""
"It is not really possible to remove components itself in a sane way yet "
"without requiring either to ship a locally modified B<live-config> package "
"or using dpkg-divert. However, the same can be achieved by disabling the "
"respective components through the live-config.nocomponents mechanism, see "
"above. To avoid to always need specifying disabled components through the "
"boot parameter, a configuration file should be used, see above."
msgstr ""
"Sebenarnya tidak mungkin untuk menghapus komponen itu sendiri dengan cara "
"yang baik tanpa memerlukan pengiriman paket B<live-config> yang dimodifikasi "
"secara lokal atau menggunakan dpkg-divert. Namun, hal yang sama dapat "
"dicapai dengan menonaktifkan komponen yang bersangkutan melalui mekanisme "
"live-config.nocomponents, lihat di atas. Untuk menghindari keharusan selalu "
"menentukan komponen yang dinonaktifkan melalui parameter boot, file "
"konfigurasi harus digunakan, lihat di atas."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:284
msgid ""
"The configuration files for the live system itself are best put into an own "
"debian package. A sample package containing an example configuration can be "
"found in /usr/share/doc/live-config/examples."
msgstr ""
"File-file konfigurasi untuk sistem live itu sendiri sebaiknya dimasukkan ke "
"dalam paket debian sendiri. Contoh paket yang berisi konfigurasi contoh "
"dapat ditemukan di /usr/share/doc/live-config/examples."

#. type: SH
#: en/live-config.7:285
#, no-wrap
msgid "COMPONENTS"
msgstr "KOMPONEN"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:287
msgid ""
"B<live-config> currently features the following components in /usr/lib/live/"
"config."
msgstr ""
"B<live-config> saat ini memiliki komponen-komponen berikut di /usr/lib/live/"
"config."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:288
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<nss-systemd>"
msgstr "B<nss-systemd>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:290
msgid ""
"removes or restores the systemd NSS module in /etc/nsswitch.conf to work "
"around a known systemd issue."
msgstr ""
"Menghapus atau mengembalikan modul NSS systemd di /etc/nsswitch.conf untuk "
"mengatasi masalah systemd yang diketahui."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:290
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<debconf>"
msgstr "B<debconf>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:292
msgid ""
"allows one to apply arbitrary preseed files placed on the live media or an "
"http/ftp server."
msgstr ""
"Memungkinkan seseorang untuk menerapkan file preseed arbitrer yang "
"ditempatkan di media live atau server http/ftp."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:292
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<hostname>"
msgstr "B<hostname>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:294
msgid "configures /etc/hostname and /etc/hosts."
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi /etc/hostname dan /etc/hosts."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:294
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<issue-setup>"
msgstr "B<issue-setup>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:296
msgid ""
"sets up the /etc/issue file with a welcome banner and distribution "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Mengatur file /etc/issue dengan spanduk selamat datang dan informasi "
"distribusi."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:296
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<live-debconfig_passwd>"
msgstr "B<live-debconfig_passwd>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:298
msgid "configures user and root passwords via live-debconfig."
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi kata sandi pengguna dan root melalui live-debconfig."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:298
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<user-setup>"
msgstr "B<user-setup>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:300
msgid "adds a live user account."
msgstr "Menambahkan akun pengguna live."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:300
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<user-groups>"
msgstr "B<user-groups>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:302
msgid ""
"adds the live user to supplementary groups declared by installed modules. "
"Existing groups listed in /usr/share/live/config/user-default-groups.d/"
"*.groups are applied after user creation and on later live-config runs."
msgstr ""
"menambahkan pengguna live ke grup tambahan yang dideklarasikan oleh modul "
"yang terpasang. Grup yang sudah ada dan tercantum di /usr/share/live/config/"
"user-default-groups.d/*.groups akan diterapkan setelah pembuatan pengguna "
"dan pada eksekusi live-config berikutnya."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:302
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<root-setup>"
msgstr "B<root-setup>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:304
msgid ""
"sets or updates the root password and configures the root user environment."
msgstr ""
"Mengatur atau memperbarui kata sandi root dan mengonfigurasi lingkungan "
"pengguna root."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:304
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<sudo>"
msgstr "B<sudo>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:306
msgid "grants sudo privileges to the live user."
msgstr "Memberikan hak istimewa sudo kepada pengguna live."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:306
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<user-ssh-keys>"
msgstr "B<user-ssh-keys>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:308
msgid ""
"synchronizes user-specific I<authorized_keys.E<lt>usernameE<gt>> files "
"between the live medium and individual user home directories. Supports "
"multiple users simultaneously (e.g., I<authorized_keys.root>, "
"I<authorized_keys.live>, I<authorized_keys.admin>)."
msgstr ""
"menyinkronkan berkas I<authorized_keys.E<lt>usernameE<gt>> khusus pengguna "
"antara media live dan direktori home masing-masing pengguna. Mendukung "
"beberapa pengguna secara bersamaan (misalnya, I<authorized_keys.root>, "
"I<authorized_keys.live>, I<authorized_keys.admin>)."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:308
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<user-media>"
msgstr "B<user-media>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:311
msgid ""
"links or bind-mounts validated user directories on the existing writable "
"MiniOS data medium, with safe migration and copy-back when disabled."
msgstr ""
"menautkan atau bind-mount direktori pengguna yang telah divalidasi pada "
"media data MiniOS yang dapat ditulis, dengan migrasi dan penyalinan kembali "
"yang aman saat dinonaktifkan."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:311
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<locales>"
msgstr "B<locales>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:313
msgid "configures locales."
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi lokal."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:313
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<tzdata>"
msgstr "B<tzdata>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:315
msgid "configures /etc/timezone."
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi /etc/timezone."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:315
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<xorg-service>"
msgstr "B<xorg-service>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:317
msgid ""
"configures username in xorg.service and applies X11 posture when supported."
msgstr ""
"mengonfigurasi nama pengguna di xorg.service dan menerapkan posture X11 jika "
"didukung."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:317
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<gdm3>"
msgstr "B<gdm3>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:319
msgid "configures autologin in gdm3."
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi autologin di gdm3."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:319
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<sddm>"
msgstr "B<sddm>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:321
msgid "configures autologin in sddm."
msgstr "mengonfigurasi autologin di sddm."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:321
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<kdm>"
msgstr "B<kdm>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:323
msgid "configures autologin in kdm."
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi autologin di kdm."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:323
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<lightdm>"
msgstr "B<lightdm>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:325
msgid "configures autologin in lightdm."
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi autologin di lightdm."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:325
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<lxdm>"
msgstr "B<lxdm>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:327
msgid "configures autologin in lxdm."
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi autologin di lxdm."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:327
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<nodm>"
msgstr "B<nodm>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:329
msgid "configures autologin in nodm."
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi autologin di nodm."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:329
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<slim>"
msgstr "B<slim>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:331
msgid "configures autologin in slim."
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi autologin di slim."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:331
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<xinit>"
msgstr "B<xinit>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:333
msgid "configures autologin with xinit."
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi autologin dengan xinit."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:333
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<keyboard-configuration>"
msgstr "B<keyboard-configuration>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:335
msgid "configures the keyboard."
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi keyboard."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:335
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<sysvinit>"
msgstr "B<sysvinit>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:338
msgid ""
"configures console autologin through /etc/inittab when sysvinit is "
"installed.  The noautologin and nottyautologin shortcuts suppress that setup."
msgstr ""
"mengonfigurasi autologin konsol melalui /etc/inittab ketika sysvinit "
"terpasang. Pintasan noautologin dan nottyautologin akan menonaktifkan "
"pengaturan tersebut."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:338
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<sysv-rc>"
msgstr "B<sysv-rc>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:340
msgid "configures sysv-rc by disabling listed services."
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi sysv-rc dengan menonaktifkan layanan yang terdaftar."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:340
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<apport>"
msgstr "B<apport>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:342
msgid "disables apport."
msgstr "Menonaktifkan apport."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:342
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<gnome-panel-data>"
msgstr "B<gnome-panel-data>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:344
msgid "disables lock button for the screen."
msgstr "Menonaktifkan tombol kunci untuk layar."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:344
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<gnome-power-manager>"
msgstr "B<gnome-power-manager>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:346
msgid "disables hibernation."
msgstr "Menonaktifkan hibernasi."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:346
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<gnome-screensaver>"
msgstr "B<gnome-screensaver>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:348
msgid "controls GNOME screen locking according to LIVE_LOCKSCREEN_MODE."
msgstr "mengontrol penguncian layar GNOME sesuai dengan LIVE_LOCKSCREEN_MODE."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:348
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<kaboom>"
msgstr "B<kaboom>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:350
msgid "disables KDE migration wizard (squeeze and newer)."
msgstr "Menonaktifkan wizard migrasi KDE (squeeze dan yang lebih baru)."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:350
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<kde-services>"
msgstr "B<kde-services>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:352
msgid "disables some unwanted KDE services (squeeze and newer)."
msgstr ""
"Menonaktifkan beberapa layanan KDE yang tidak diinginkan (squeeze dan yang "
"lebih baru)."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:352
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<policykit>"
msgstr "B<policykit>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:354
msgid "grants user privileges through PolicyKit."
msgstr "memberikan hak istimewa pengguna melalui PolicyKit."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:354
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<ssl-cert>"
msgstr "B<ssl-cert>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:356
msgid "regenerates SSL snake-oil certificates."
msgstr "menghasilkan ulang sertifikat SSL snake-oil."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:356
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<xrdp>"
msgstr "B<xrdp>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:358
msgid ""
"configures relaxed, hardened, or disabled XRDP posture when XRDP is "
"installed."
msgstr ""
"mengonfigurasi posture XRDP relaxed, hardened, atau disabled saat XRDP "
"terpasang."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:358
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<anacron>"
msgstr "B<anacron>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:360
msgid "disables anacron."
msgstr "Menonaktifkan anacron."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:360
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<util-linux>"
msgstr "B<util-linux>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:362
msgid "disables the util-linux hwclock service."
msgstr "menonaktifkan layanan util-linux hwclock."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:362
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<login>"
msgstr "B<login>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:364
msgid "disables lastlog."
msgstr "Menonaktifkan lastlog."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:364
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<xserver-xorg>"
msgstr "B<xserver-xorg>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:366
msgid "configures xserver-xorg."
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi xserver-xorg."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:366
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<network>"
msgstr "B<jaringan>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:368
msgid ""
"configures durable wired IPv4 policy through a secure NetworkManager keyfile "
"or ifupdown stanza. It runs before networking services, validates all "
"values, and stamps only after a successful write."
msgstr ""
"mengonfigurasi kebijakan IPv4 kabel yang tahan lama melalui keyfile "
"NetworkManager yang aman atau stanza ifupdown. Proses ini dijalankan sebelum "
"layanan jaringan, memvalidasi semua nilai, dan hanya menandai setelah "
"penulisan berhasil."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:368
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<openssh-server>"
msgstr "B<openssh-server>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:371
msgid ""
"recreates OpenSSH host keys and writes explicitly requested root-login or "
"password-authentication policy."
msgstr ""
"membuat ulang kunci host OpenSSH dan menulis kebijakan root-login atau "
"password-authentication yang diminta secara eksplisit."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:371
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<xfce4-panel>"
msgstr "B<xfce4-panel>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:373
msgid "configures xfce4-panel to default settings."
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi xfce4-panel ke pengaturan default."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:373
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<xscreensaver>"
msgstr "B<xscreensaver>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:375
msgid "controls xscreensaver locking according to LIVE_LOCKSCREEN_MODE."
msgstr "mengontrol penguncian xscreensaver sesuai dengan LIVE_LOCKSCREEN_MODE."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:375
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<broadcom-sta>"
msgstr "B<broadcom-sta>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:377
msgid "configures broadcom-sta WLAN drivers."
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi driver WLAN broadcom-sta."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:377
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<hyperv>"
msgstr "B<hyperv>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:379
msgid ""
"configures X11 settings to improve compatibility on Microsoft Hyper-V "
"platforms."
msgstr ""
"mengonfigurasi pengaturan X11 untuk meningkatkan kompatibilitas pada "
"platform Microsoft Hyper-V."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:379
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<ntfs3>"
msgstr "B<ntfs3>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:381
msgid "manages udev rules for NTFS3 support."
msgstr "Mengelola aturan udev untuk dukungan NTFS3."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:381
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<config-module-mode>"
msgstr "B<config-module-mode>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:383
msgid ""
"configures system module mode and updates caches, user settings, and dpkg."
msgstr ""
"Mengonfigurasi mode modul sistem dan memperbarui cache, pengaturan pengguna, "
"dan dpkg."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:383
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<hooks>"
msgstr "B<hooks>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:385
msgid ""
"allows one to run arbitrary commands from a file placed on the live media or "
"an http/ftp server."
msgstr ""
"Memungkinkan seseorang untuk menjalankan perintah arbitrer dari sebuah file "
"yang ditempatkan di media live atau server http/ftp."

#. type: SH
#: en/live-config.7:386
#, no-wrap
msgid "FILES"
msgstr "FILE"

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:387
#, no-wrap
msgid "B</etc/live/config.conf>"
msgstr "B</etc/live/config.conf>"

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:388
#, no-wrap
msgid "B</etc/live/config.conf.d/*.conf>"
msgstr "B</etc/live/config.conf.d/*.conf>"

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:389
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<minios/config.conf>"
msgstr "B<minios/config.conf>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:391
msgid ""
"Configuration file on the live medium, copied to /etc/live/config.conf only "
"when the destination does not exist."
msgstr ""
"Berkas konfigurasi pada media live, disalin ke /etc/live/config.conf hanya "
"jika tujuan belum ada."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:391
#, no-wrap
msgid "B</usr/lib/live/init-config.sh>"
msgstr "B</usr/lib/live/init-config.sh>"

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:392
#, no-wrap
msgid "B</usr/lib/live/config.sh>"
msgstr "B</usr/lib/live/config.sh>"

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:393
#, no-wrap
msgid "B</usr/lib/live/config/>"
msgstr "B</usr/lib/live/config/>"

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:394
#, no-wrap
msgid "B</usr/share/live/config/user-default-groups.d/*.groups>"
msgstr "B</usr/share/live/config/user-default-groups.d/*.groups>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/live-config.7:396
msgid ""
"Module-provided supplementary groups for the live user. Group names may be "
"separated by whitespace; blank lines and comments beginning with # are "
"ignored. Only groups that exist in the running system are applied."
msgstr ""
"Grup tambahan yang disediakan modul untuk pengguna live. Nama grup dapat "
"dipisahkan dengan spasi; baris kosong dan komentar yang diawali dengan # "
"akan diabaikan. Hanya grup yang sudah ada di sistem berjalan yang akan "
"diterapkan."

#. type: IP
#: en/live-config.7:396
